# Implementation Plan - New Project Posting Flow

The goal is to implement a robust project sharing system where users can post their projects via a dedicated page. Projects will be displayed dynamically in the Explore section, and the redundant standalone "Projects" navigation item will be removed.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Database Schema:** I will be creating a new `projects` table in Supabase. Please ensure your Supabase instance is accessible and the `.env` variables are correctly set.
> **Navigation Change:** The "Projects" tab will be removed from the sidebar. All project exploration will now happen in the "Explore" tab.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [NEW] [projects.js](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/backend/routes/projects.js)
- Implement `POST /api/projects`: Creates a new project in Supabase.
- Implement `GET /api/projects`: Fetches all projects with user profile info for the Explore page.

#### [MODIFY] [index.js](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/backend/index.js)
- Mount the new `projects` route at `/api/projects`.

### Frontend

#### [NEW] [CreateProjectPage](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/pages/CreateProjectPage/index.tsx)
- Create a premium UI form for project submission.
- Fields: Title, Description, Image URL, Tags (multi-select/custom), and GitHub URL.
- Integrate with React Query for form submission.

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/App.tsx)
- Add route for `/create-project`.
- Remove route for `/projects`.

#### [MODIFY] [Sidebar.tsx](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/pages/DashboardPage/components/Sidebar.tsx)
- Update "New Project" button to navigate to `/create-project`.
- Remove "Projects" link from the navigation items.

#### [MODIFY] [MobileNav.tsx](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/components/MobileNav.tsx)
- Remove "Projects" link from the bottom tab bar/drawer.

#### [MODIFY] [MainFeed.tsx](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/pages/DashboardPage/components/MainFeed.tsx)
- Update "New Project" button header to navigate to `/create-project`.

#### [MODIFY] [ExplorePage](file:///c:/Users/HP/OneDrive/Desktop/stitch/frontend/src/pages/ExplorePage/index.tsx)
- Fetch real projects from the backend via React Query.
- Update components to handle the real data structure.

## Open Questions

- **Image Uploads:** Do you want to support physical image uploads to Supabase Storage, or just pasting an image URL for now? (I'll start with URLs as it's faster, but can add storage later).
- **Project Structure:** Should projects also have "Likes" and "Comments" separate from the existing Post system? (I recommend a unified interaction system).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Verify project creation via Network tab logs.
- Verify Explore page lists the new project.

### Manual Verification
- Navigate to "New Project" -> Fill form -> Submit -> Check Explore.
- Verify "Projects" link is removed from Sidebar.
